      "text": "定义全景朝向的 3×3 变换矩阵。未指定时，默认使用真赤道平春分点（TEME）坐标轴。"
    },
    {
      "id": "CubeMapPanorama#credit",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:bcd3144f593b07b3c6f9d12af369e5f03e4e075616802fa38fa03eeaa8bc5227",
      "text": "获取全景署名。"
    },
    {
      "id": "CubeMapPanorama#destroy",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:b385add820d9f47d540aad147f1cdf85f05e8c6cb81c3928a59c8fd5f7bd8d69",
      "text": "销毁此对象持有的 WebGL 资源。显式销毁可确定地释放 WebGL 资源，而不依赖垃圾回收器回收此对象。<br /><br />对象销毁后不应再使用；调用除 <code>isDestroyed</code> 以外的任何函数都会抛出 {@link DeveloperError}。因此，应像示例中那样将返回值（<code>undefined</code>）赋给该对象变量。"
    },
    {
      "id": "CubeMapPanorama#isDestroyed",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:aea7b697937631c90ae3fc0ec55b81ba0ddc7abe4d6045848b2031f9bed60091",
      "text": "若此对象已销毁，返回 true；否则返回 false。<br /><br />对象销毁后不应再使用；调用除 <code>isDestroyed</code> 以外的任何函数都会抛出 {@link DeveloperError}。"
    },
    {
      "id": "CubeMapPanorama#show",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:9f9ddab6b598ce5fe0da35253b8e6aec4a8dffe3496d0af7366aab93db207ba0",
      "text": "决定是否显示立方体贴图全景。"
    },
    {
      "id": "CubeMapPanorama#sources",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:2ab1837535ea037aeb1e7848d202394f9123a155384e7ecbaa114fa10c061eaf",
      "text": "创建立方体各面的源对象，包含 <code>positiveX</code>、<code>negativeX</code>、<code>positiveY</code>、<code>negativeY</code>、<code>positiveZ</code>、<code>negativeZ</code> 属性，各值可以是 URL 或 <code>Image</code> 对象。"
    },
    {
      "id": "CubeMapPanorama#transform",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:b88244ea5218b357c4e2f5ca1da90e932341cdbfd6ba5e2be180bf0f546f24cf",
      "text": "获取全景变换。为 undefined 时，默认朝向使用真赤道平春分点（TEME）坐标轴。"
    },
    {
      "id": "CubeMapPanorama#update",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:c5cc5fb756479265000e8f5e05ef6b5630397b1880c9ff3316fe45c545c6b022",
      "text": "由 {@link Viewer} 或 {@link CesiumWidget} 在渲染场景时调用，以获取渲染此图元所需的绘制命令。<p>不要直接调用。此处记录此函数，仅为列出场景渲染期间可能向上传播的异常：</p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "CubeMapPanorama#update",
      "field": "exceptions/0/description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:3e6209105b398730395ae76086219dfba7c81014e01568180392e268ee66ae41",
      "text": "必须提供 this.sources，且须包含 positiveX、negativeX、positiveY、negativeY、positiveZ 和 negativeZ 属性。"
    },
    {
      "id": "CubeMapPanorama#update",
      "field": "exceptions/1/description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:ed70a676f47092bf099ad848c8ca06093dd9ea28cc25d038633404271f0ba71b",
      "text": "this.sources 的全部属性必须为相同类型。"
    },
    {
      "id": "CubeMapPanorama",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:ef685100e75a27adcccd3c4e47f40ff4fc336e16a37ee09ede0447bcb9e3f9ad",
      "text": "在场景中显示立方体贴图影像的 {@link Panorama}。\n<p>\n仅支持三维模式。切换到二维或 Columbus View 的形变过程中逐渐淡出。立方体全景尺寸不能超过 {@link Scene#maximumSkyBoxSize}。\n</p>"
    },
