      "sourceHash": "sha256:3e09394416cec2d192c8bcf3ee2c08fe64d7bbe9e9479482c4d7e12d7a7b1984",
      "text": "包含最近全景的 panoId、纬度和经度的对象。"
    },
    {
      "id": "GoogleStreetViewCubeMapPanoramaProvider#getPanoIdMetadata",
      "field": "description",
