      "sourceHash": "sha256:6f0aa258036bd5938b3e80729b8928b8990d43d0eaa8c9a8936b2aee19f859fa",
      "text": "全景在场景中的放置位置。"
    },
    {
      "id": "GoogleStreetViewCubeMapPanoramaProvider#loadPanorama",
      "field": "params/options.panoId/description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:cb4a10e0e300ffa5b0da668f71bf27c8fb297418b9c5224c72c0d7fce116c27f",
      "text": "Google API 中的 panoramaId 图像标识符。未提供时，根据给定地理位置查询。"
    },
    {
      "id": "GoogleStreetViewCubeMapPanoramaProvider#loadPanorama",
      "field": "params/options.signature/description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:c4381ad3c3f9aa80751ef5b24c2cbe62949f87121139d0ba243979352ae6221a",
      "text": "用于签名 URL 的可选签名，参见 {@link https://developers.google.com/maps/documentation/streetview/digital-signature}。"
    },
    {
      "id": "GoogleStreetViewCubeMapPanoramaProvider#loadPanorama",
      "field": "params/options.tileSize/description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:03746f5ce173fd1b31100bc98a9745bce94d192184aead9a0ae6b7114b310317",
      "text": "覆盖默认值的可选正方形瓦片尺寸。"
    },
    {
      "id": "GoogleStreetViewCubeMapPanoramaProvider#loadPanorama",
      "field": "returns/0/description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:55eb246236ba7d520eadbfa0405fa514fe79a3e2287cf2dfa90486d2e37791f8",
      "text": "已贴上影像的全景图元。"
    },
    {
      "id": "GoogleStreetViewCubeMapPanoramaProvider",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:44e255d57fc13eb0c855c148b7a4bf2f7144d53157515d2641dc7da7c44deb04",
      "text": "<div class=\"notice\">\n通常不直接实例化此对象，请使用 {@link GoogleStreetViewCubeMapPanoramaProvider.fromUrl}。\n</div>\n创建 {@link PanoramaProvider}，从 {@link https://developers.google.com/maps/documentation/streetview|Google Street View Static API} 提供在全景中显示的影像。"
    },
    {
      "id": "I3SDataProvider.ConstructorOptions",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:977ccfef236e221bf500727e8f2de85397baac4bb4ff18e196c211dc0a21018e",
      "text": "I3SDataProvider 构造函数的初始化选项。"
    },
    {
      "id": "I3SDataProvider.ConstructorOptions",
      "field": "properties/adjustMaterialAlphaMode/description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:a515e86e4c7c5d731625a370cd78fc26f469f192ca3058b1f2df7159964c3d10",
      "text": "是否根据顶点颜色透明度调整材质 alpha 模式。为 <code>true</code> 时，若颜色顶点属性中存在透明度且材质尚未定义 alpha 模式，则设为 BLEND。"
    },
    {
      "id": "I3SDataProvider.ConstructorOptions",
      "field": "properties/applySymbology/description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:0cb7d338b5b0926bb23c9036cbc6f9a713c908769a3da11ddb4598f9b3776334",
      "text": "决定是否解析并应用图层的 I3S 符号系统。"
    },
    {
      "id": "I3SDataProvider.ConstructorOptions",
      "field": "properties/calculateNormals/description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:d5328cfdd35d0a78211afe1e72be4db7497ad8bda54167919530f6a50a32cb06",
      "text": "决定是否为没有法线的 I3S 几何生成平面法线。"
    },
    {
      "id": "I3SDataProvider.ConstructorOptions",
      "field": "properties/cesium3dTilesetOptions/description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:decb807bc11615b138a702f094c7de6fde4839f53cda11a3a68987f131855ccb",
      "text": "传给内部创建的 {@link Cesium3DTileset} 的选项对象，有效属性见 {@link Cesium3DTileset}。除 <code>url</code> 与 <code>show</code> 外可使用全部选项，这两项由 I3SDataProvider 的值覆盖。"
    },
    {
      "id": "I3SDataProvider.ConstructorOptions",
      "field": "properties/geoidTiledTerrainProvider/description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:e2997b3a37a701a66bcd253d7dc1b9306ce3e86826727fac07aba273b4e63b37",
      "text": "描述地球重力模型的瓦片高程提供者。指定后，根据其偏移调整几何。正确定位采用重力相关高程的 I3S 数据集时需要此项。"
    },
    {
      "id": "I3SDataProvider.ConstructorOptions",
      "field": "properties/name/description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:299da39e48673818a92a4a5046ae874e051ec69ebb3e9a047a4987cd2af82ea3",
      "text": "I3S 数据集名称。"
    },
    {
      "id": "I3SDataProvider.ConstructorOptions",
      "field": "properties/show/description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:44f16527865c532012289b9e57bb6c78b7c3e908c4100703817326ebda42c16d",
      "text": "决定是否显示数据集。"
    },
    {
      "id": "I3SDataProvider.ConstructorOptions",
      "field": "properties/showFeatures/description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:5e12af58883fdcf6448556fb0e6c22b1568b34b12567a17fdad476766b920cbf",
      "text": "决定是否显示要素。"
    },
    {
      "id": "I3SDataProvider.fromUrl",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:8cbe48ea0dfdb592a2af32a8611b0638ebbf71ec6263e8faeaee53b07e8ade24",
      "text": "创建 I3SDataProvider。当前支持 I3S 1.6 和 1.7/1.8（OGC I3S 1.2）。"
    },
    {
